# Naming

## Files and folders

- Astro sections: `SectionPascalCase.astro` under `src/components/sections/`
- Layouts: `PascalCase.astro` under `src/components/layout/` or `src/layouts/`
- Data layer: kebab-case modules under `src/lib/orbitype/`
- Types: singular domain nouns in `src/types/` (`page.ts`, `section.ts`)
- API routes: kebab-case path segments (`install-schema.ts`, `contact.ts`)
- Scripts: kebab-case `.mjs` in `scripts/`
- ADRs: `NNNN-short-kebab-title.md` in `docs/adr/`

## Symbols

- Functions and variables: `camelCase`
- Types and interfaces: `PascalCase`
- Constants shared across modules: `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` in `src/config/`
- CMS component names match filenames exactly: `"SectionHero"`, not `"hero"`

## Forbidden in this template

- Client, project, or site-specific names anywhere in the repository
- Third-party person names in docs, comments, or identifiers
- Framework-specific prefixes from other stacks (e.g. `useXxx` hooks)

Clones rename `PUBLIC_SITE_*` env vars and tokens — the template stays neutral.
